{"t":"Spellbook","s":"spellbook-38332","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Spellbook_01395b.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Spellbook</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Spellbook\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spellbook_01395b.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"vocrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">sorcerers and druids</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Combat Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"defense\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Defense</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">23</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"imbueslots\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Imbuing Slots</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Body Equipment<br/>Spellbooks<br/>Shields</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">18.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 - 150 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">150 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">May 20, 1998<br/>Beta 4.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20041125162005&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spellbook_01395b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a spellbook <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Def:23)</span>.<br/>Imbuements: (Empty Slot).<div class=\"p-reqs\">It can only be wielded properly by sorcerers and druids.<br/></div><div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 18.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It shows your spells and can also shield against attacks when worn.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>You don't need to carry your spellbook with you all the time, it isn't necessary to have a spellbook to cast a spell. It does, however, tell you which spells you have, as well as the mana and the words needed to cast each spell. The spell words can also be found at the official web site, at the ingame Spell List or on the Spells page. It looks the same as an <a href=\"#/wiki/Almanac%20of%20Magic\">Almanac of Magic</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nature%20Magic%20Spellbook\">Nature Magic Spellbook</a> and Spellbook of Dragha. It has been made somewhat redundant by the <a href=\"#/wiki/Flash%20Client\">Flash Client</a>'s ability to list a character's known spells.\nObtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/elvenbane-quest\">Elvenbane Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/ornamented-shield-quest\">Ornamented Shield Quest</a> and daily spawn on the top of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Senja\">Senja</a> Castle.<br/>\n<a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerers</a> require a spellbook for <a href=\"#/quest/the-desert-dungeon-quest\">The Desert Dungeon Quest</a>.\n<span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Spellbook (Alternative) </i> </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before Updates/8.2, spellbooks didn't have a defence value, and couldn't be used as a shield. Before Updates/8.5, spellbooks had a weight of 58.00 oz, which has been significantly decreased.\n</p>\n<ul><li>As announced on June 16, 2026, the Vocation Adjustments Update 2026 raised its defense from 14 to 23</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Banshee\">Banshee</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord\">Bonelord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bonelord%20%28Nostalgia%29\">Bonelord (Nostalgia)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Braindeath\">Braindeath</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Clavius